# Sustainable Fashion Research Plan<br>
<br>
## Goals and Objectives<br>
<br>
* Gather insights on sustainable production methods from potential designers and manufacturers.<br>
* Identify best practices for reducing environmental impact in the fashion industry.<br>
* Develop a comprehensive understanding of the current state of sustainable fashion production.<br>
<br>
## Methodologies<br>
<br>
* Conduct interviews with 5-7 potential designers and manufacturers.<br>
* Collect data on their current production processes, materials used, and waste management strategies.<br>
* Analyze the data to identify trends, challenges, and opportunities for improvement.<br>
<br>
## Schedule<br>
<br>
* Week 1: Identify potential interviewees and schedule interviews.<br>
* Week 2-3: Conduct interviews and collect data.<br>
* Week 4: Analyze data and develop recommendations for sustainable production methods.<br>
```<br>
